    "title": "Check Your Understanding",
    "long_instructions": "#### Think about how apps communicate with users while data is loading or missing.\r\n\r\n> 1. Describe a time you saw a loading indicator in an app. How did it affect your trust or patience while waiting?\r\n>\r\n> 2. Imagine a search returns no results, but the app only shows a blank white screen. What might the user think happened?\r\n>\r\n> 3. What should the app show instead, and why?",
